String scopedFlowName\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":94},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - subflow\\(String scopedSubflowName\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":95},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":103},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":154},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - Scoped","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":203},{"title":"Data Stream actions and pagination","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/integrate-applications/data-stream-actions.md","line":238},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":246},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - action\\(String scopedActionName\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":287},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - subflow\\(String scopedSubflowName\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":288},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":296},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":341},{"title":"insert","target":"r_Insert","line":374},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":399},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":449},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":518},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - action\\(String scopedActionName\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":614},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - flow\\(String scopedFlowName\\)","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":615},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":623},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":670},{"title":"Supporting multiple connections","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/integrate-applications/support-multiple-connections.md","line":784},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":793},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":827},{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - Scoped","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md","line":877},{"title":"insert","target":"r_Insert","line":911}],"metadata":{"title":"ScriptableFlowRunner - Scoped","description":"Creates a builder object used to define parameters for flow, subflow, and action execution. You can specify a flow to execute in a particular domain. Start the flow, subflow, or action execution directly from the builder and view the results in a ScriptableFlowRunnerResult object.Identifies the scope and name of the action to execute.Adds a single input. If the name passed as an argument already exists as a separate input, the new value replaces the pre-existing value.Runs flow as the user who triggered it, not the system, for quick background executions.Identifies the scope and name of the data stream action to execute.Identifies the scope and name of the flow to execute.Runs the flow, subflow, or action asynchronously. Once the flow object starts running, script execution resumes immediately.Runs the flow, subflow, or action in the specified domain. Checks to ensure the domain exists and is available.Runs the flow, subflow, or action synchronously. Script execution pauses while the flow object is running.Runs a flow, subflow, action, or Data Stream action from a server-side script synchronously or asynchronously without creating execution details or other related records. Improves performance by eliminating record-keeping overhead. Use this API to increase the speed of high-volume processing, for example multiple executions per second, in a production environment.Runs the flow, subflow, or action with the specified parameters.Identifies the scope and name of the subflow to execute.Sets a timeout for a flow, subflow, or action execution.Throw an error and prevent the ScriptableFlowRunner class from running when any method input has an unexpected value. This method defaults to true for any ScriptableFlowRunner call.Overrides the Connections and Credentials alias associated with the flow, action, or subflow. You can override the default parent alias with any of its child aliases.Adds a collection of inputs. If a name in one of the name-value pairs already exists, the new value replaces the pre-existing value.Runs the flow as the user who triggered the flow or executes the flow with roles that have been added in Workflow Studio.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.html","release":"australia","product":"Server API Reference","classification":"server-api-reference","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":20,"breadcrumb":["Server API reference","API reference","API implementation and reference"],"tags":["#api-reference","#glidesystem","#gliderecord","#server-side","#glide","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[52,84],[107,139],[158,176],[180,189],[207,224],[250,267],[271,279],[300,317],[321,329],[347,364],[368,387],[403,435],[453,485],[524,542],[546,558],[574,606],[627,644],[648,658],[674,692],[696,706],[748,766],[770,778],[797,815],[831,863],[881,899]],"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/api-reference/server-api-reference/ScriptableFlowRunnerScopedAPI.md"},
